# MSG_RETRY: the battle module only checks the shape of an answer; whether one tribute is enough
# is a game rule the core checks. One tribute for Blue-Eyes is rejected, the core asks again
# (new prompt id, retry flag), and two tributes are accepted.
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
card 0 hand 25259669        # Goblindbergh
card 0 hand 43096270        # Alexandrite Dragon
card 0 hand 89631139        # Blue-Eyes White Dragon (needs 2 tributes)
card 0 deck 15025844 x5
card 1 deck 15025844 x5

0 idle summon 25259669
0 yesno yes
0 select 43096270
0 idle end
1 idle end
0 idle summon 89631139
0 select 25259669           # only one tribute
expect retry
0 select 25259669 43096270
expect count 0 mzone 1
expect count 0 grave 2
stop
